---
import "../style.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="See how avocadoMini, avokadoPro, and RockstarOS can turn movement and space into tools for care research, product development, everyday life, and games." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avokado — Mini meets Pro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Make the room part of the experience." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <title>avokado — Mini meets Pro</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="apple-home">
  <a class="skip" href="#main-content">Skip to products</a>
  <header class="apple-home-nav">
    <a class="apple-home-brand" href="/" aria-label="avokado home"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />avokado</a>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <details class="site-menu">
        <summary>Menu</summary>
        <div class="site-menu-panel">
          <p>EXPLORE AVOKADO</p>
          <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
            <a href="/mini/"><span>01</span><strong>avocadoMini</strong><em>Let the space respond to movement</em></a>
            <a href="/pro/"><span>02</span><strong>avokadoPro</strong><em>Bring games and services into the room</em></a>
            <a href="/install/"><span>03</span><strong>RockstarOS</strong><em>The system foundation</em></a>
            <a href="/rocket-star/"><span>04</span><strong>rocketstar</strong><em>Launch system design</em></a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </details>
      <a class="header-cta" href="/preorder/">Price & status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section id="together" class="home-promo home-promo-system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOKADO / SPATIAL EXPERIENCES</p>
        <h1 id="system-title">Make the room part<br />of the experience.</h1>
        <span>Start with the product that gives you what you want. Add more only when the experience grows.</span>
        <div><a href="#possibilities">See what it can do <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="#choose-setup">Find your setup <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit.png" alt="Four avocadoMini towers arranged around the separately sold avokadoPro Hub" fetchpriority="high" />
      <p class="home-promo-note">Mini and Pro each work on their own. Pair them when you want spatial play.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="possibilities" class="possibility-atlas" aria-labelledby="possibilities-title">
      <div class="possibility-atlas-head">
        <p>FROM PC TO PHYSICAL SPACE</p>
        <h2 id="possibilities-title">Do something.<br />The room responds.</h2>
        <span>Instead of giving every command through a screen, use movement, position, and the space around you.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="system-role-strip" aria-label="How the avokado system works">
        <div><span>01</span><strong>Mini sees.</strong><p>It turns movement and position into input.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><strong>Pro runs.</strong><p>It runs the local app or game and keeps its data.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><strong>RockstarOS connects.</strong><p>It controls which hardware and services work together.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="possibility-grid">
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-care">
          <img src="/images/usecase-care-motion-v3.jpg" alt="Three steps: a participant balances, avocadoMini senses the step, and a researcher reviews the motion" loading="lazy" />
          <ol class="possibility-flow" aria-label="How this use case works"><li>Take a step</li><li>Mini reads movement</li><li>Review motion</li></ol>
          <div><span>01 / CARE + MOTION RESEARCH</span><h3>Walk or balance.<br />Review the movement.</h3><p>Record how a person moves through a defined area, then compare sessions for training, ergonomics, or research.</p><dl><div><dt>Mini</dt><dd>Sees the movement</dd></div><div><dt>Pro</dt><dd>Runs review tools and stores sessions</dd></div></dl><small>Concept use case. Not a cleared medical or diagnostic device.</small></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-research">
          <img src="/images/usecase-research-development-v3.jpg" alt="Three steps: a researcher moves a prototype, avocadoMini senses it, and software reflects its position" loading="lazy" />
          <ol class="possibility-flow" aria-label="How this use case works"><li>Move a prototype</li><li>Mini reads position</li><li>Software reflects it</li></ol>
          <div><span>02 / RESEARCH + DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Move a prototype.<br />See it in software.</h3><p>Track a hand, tool, or moving object and send its position into an app while you test a new interface.</p><dl><div><dt>Mini</dt><dd>Measures position and movement</dd></div><div><dt>Pro</dt><dd>Runs the experiment locally</dd></div></dl></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-life">
          <img src="/images/usecase-everyday-space-v3.jpg" alt="Three steps: a person raises a hand, avocadoMini senses the gesture, and a lamp turns on" loading="lazy" />
          <ol class="possibility-flow" aria-label="How this use case works"><li>Raise a hand</li><li>Mini sees the gesture</li><li>Light turns on</li></ol>
          <div><span>03 / EVERYDAY SPACE</span><h3>Raise a hand.<br />Change the room.</h3><p>Use a simple gesture or presence trigger to control lights, music, or another approved home action.</p><dl><div><dt>Mini</dt><dd>Recognizes the trigger</dd></div><div><dt>RockstarOS</dt><dd>Sends the approved action</dd></div></dl></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-game">
          <img src="/images/usecase-spatial-game-v3.jpg" alt="Three steps: two people move, four avocadoMini units track the play area, and the game responds on screen" loading="lazy" />
          <ol class="possibility-flow" aria-label="How this use case works"><li>Move your body</li><li>Minis track the zone</li><li>Game responds</li></ol>
          <div><span>04 / GAME</span><h3>Dodge or reach.<br />The game reacts.</h3><p>Run the game on Pro and use Mini so each player's position and movement become controls.</p><dl><div><dt>Pro</dt><dd>Runs the game and audio</dd></div><div><dt>Mini</dt><dd>Turns the room into the controller</dd></div></dl></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="possibility-atlas-next"><p>One family. Different starting points.</p><a href="#choose-setup">Choose what you need <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section id="choose-setup" class="setup-chooser" aria-labelledby="setup-title">
      <div class="setup-chooser-head"><p>CHOOSE BY WHAT YOU WANT</p><h2 id="setup-title">Start with the benefit.<br />Build from there.</h2></div>
      <div class="setup-choices">
        <a href="/mini/"><span>01 / FEEL THE SPACE</span><strong>Turn movement into input.</strong><em>Choose avocadoMini →</em></a>
        <a href="/pro/"><span>02 / PLAY & ACCESS</span><strong>Bring games and services closer.</strong><em>Choose avokadoPro →</em></a>
        <a href="/pro/#pro-pairing"><span>03 / EXPAND THE ROOM</span><strong>Let the whole room join in.</strong><em>Combine Mini + Pro →</em></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-mini" aria-labelledby="mini-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOCADOMINI / TOWER20 E3</p>
        <h2 id="mini-title">Your movement.<br />Now part of the experience.</h2>
        <span>Start with one for local spatial experiences. From ¥160,000.</span>
        <div><a href="/mini/">See what Mini gives you <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">Price & status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/tower20-e3-front-transparent-v2.png" alt="Front view of avocadoMini Tower20 E3" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-pro" aria-labelledby="pro-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOKADOPRO / GAME + SERVICES HUB</p>
        <h2 id="pro-title">Games and services.<br />Ready for the room.</h2>
        <span>Use Pro on its own. Add Mini when you want spatial play. From ¥880,000.</span>
        <div><a href="/pro/">See what Pro unlocks <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">Price & status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-edge-hub-v1.png" alt="avokadoPro Hub connected to avocadoMini towers" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-tile-grid" aria-label="More from avokado">
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-os"><div><p>ROCKSTAROS</p><h2>One foundation.<br />Less friction.</h2><span>The system layer for approved products and experiences.</span><a href="/install/">Check RockstarOS status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><div class="home-os-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-four"><div><p>FOUR-MINI PACKAGE</p><h2>More viewpoints.<br />More room to move.</h2><span>Expand coverage when one viewpoint is not enough. ¥410,000 reference package.</span><a href="/mini/#product">Build your Mini setup <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-200mm-v1.png" alt="Multiple avocadoMini towers defining a shared play area" loading="lazy" /></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-pair"><div><p>MINI + PRO</p><h2>The room joins<br />the game.</h2><span>Mini adds spatial input. Pro brings games and services.</span><a href="/pro/#pro-pairing">Build the system <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit-transparent-v2.png" alt="avocadoMini and avokadoPro system" loading="lazy" /></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-rocket"><div><p>ROCKETSTAR</p><h2>Beyond the room.</h2><span>Explore the launch system design.</span><a href="/rocket-star/">Explore rocketstar <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/rocket-star-orbit.png" alt="rocketstar launch system concept" loading="lazy" /></article>
    </section>
    <section class="support-cta" aria-labelledby="support-title"><p>FOLLOW THE BUILD</p><h2 id="support-title">Want to see this become real?</h2><span>Follow development, share the project, and help the next experience find its audience.</span><div><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kirin.41/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow development ↗</a><a href="/preorder/">See price & status →</a></div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="apple-home-footer"><p>Reference prices exclude tax and shipping. Product designs and specifications remain subject to validation.</p><div><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/mini/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/pro/">avokadoPro</a><a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">Development repository ↗</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
